### Nancy - Expiry Alerts & Reporting: manual API tests (VS Code REST Client, Manual C)
### Get tokens with:  npm run token -- 2 staff   /   npm run token -- 1 admin   (until Momen's login runs)
@base = http://localhost:3003
@auth = http://localhost:3002
@token = PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Log in (staff)
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@foodbank.local", "password": "YOUR_SEED_STAFF_PASSWORD" }

### F1 - items expiring in the next 7 days (200)
GET {{base}}/api/alerts/expiry?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F1 - invalid days (400)
GET {{base}}/api/alerts/expiry?days=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F2 - run the scan (201)
POST {{base}}/api/alerts/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F2 - list active alerts (200)
GET {{base}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F2 - acknowledge alert 1 (200, or 409 if not open)
PATCH {{base}}/api/alerts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "acknowledged" }

### F2 - resolve alert 1 as discarded (200)
PATCH {{base}}/api/alerts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "resolved", "resolution_action": "discarded", "note": "Past date" }

### SECURITY - staff changes settings (403)
PUT {{base}}/api/alerts/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warning_days": 30, "critical_days": 2, "email_enabled": false, "notify_emails": [] }

### Admin changes settings (200)
PUT {{base}}/api/alerts/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warning_days": 7, "critical_days": 2, "email_enabled": true, "notify_emails": ["manager@example.com"] }

### F3 - inventory report, dairy only (200)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/inventory?category=dairy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F3 - distributions report for a date range (200)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/distributions?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F3 - impossible date (400)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/distributions?from=2026-02-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F4 - export waste report to S3 (201)
POST {{base}}/api/reports/exports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "waste" }

### F4 - list my exports (200)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/exports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F4 - download link (200 owner / 403 another staff member)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/exports/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SECURITY - no token (401)
GET {{base}}/api/alerts
